@smits_gambhir We have a list of >400 parameters, which have attributed priority and severity. So on a case to case basis ReSO recommends the fixes.

Human intervention is required to make the recommended changes on site. What ReSO does is tell you which issues to fix (week by week basis), why and how to fix them.

As a team we also have biweekly meetings with all our users to guide them through the process

